WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.884
Now let's rank employees within each department The
RANK window function

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.558
calculates a position inside each department
PARTITION BY restarts the ranking for

00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:15.702
each department and ORDER BY salary descending makes
the highest salary rank

00:00:15.729 --> 00:00:21.998
first Run the query and inspect the department
boundaries You

00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:27.563
should see rank one appear separately in each
department Notice that

00:00:27.576 --> 00:00:32.302
every employee row remains visible That is the major
difference from a

00:00:32.315 --> 00:00:38.032
grouped salary report If two employees have the same
salary RANK

00:00:38.058 --> 00:00:42.377
can produce ties and skip the next rank number That
behavior is

00:00:42.403 --> 00:00:46.140
useful to remember when comparing RANK with other
ranking functions such as

00:00:46.153 --> 00:00:48.521
DENSE_RANK or ROW_NUMBER
